      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Specifically:\n\nThe issue is apparent when you go to the tags of a world, select one of the tags with an upper case letter in it (we tried this with DataCenter), and get search results for that tag. This specific search will be different and not include the same results than a world search that is all lower case.",
